e_Grand_Strand_Beachfront.jpg","contentLocation":{"@type":"Place","name":"oceanfront, seen from the beach, Myrtle Beach, South Carolina"},"representativeOfPage":true}]}</script></div></section><section style="background:var(--navy);padding:3rem 0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Want the numbers for a rental you are looking at?</h2><p style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.75);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1.6rem">Send us the address. We put the rent, tax, insurance, dues and the manager's fee side by side. Once we work together, we introduce the managers we recommend.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Send us the address</a></div></section></main>
