+A vacation rental manager costs more. In the rentals we have seen, a basic plan takes about 13 to 17 percent of the bookings. Full service takes about 40 to 60 percent of the profit after costs, not of the bookings. Chapter3 does not manage property. We work out what you keep after the manager's fee.
 
-## What must the management agreement say?
-State law requires a written agreement. It must name the parties, identify the property, state how the manager is paid, state the renewal terms and any renewal pay, and set the terms for tenants. An automatic renewal is allowed only with a clause that lets either side cancel on 30 days' notice once the first term ends.
