+
+<div class="column" style="padding: 1rem; border-radius: .25rem; background: var(--compare);">
+<p>Horry County Register of Deeds<br>Customer Service and Recording Desk<br><br>Will close at <strong>3:30PM </strong>on<br><strong>Tuesday, June 30, 2026<br></strong>In order to complete the<br>2026 Fiscal Year-End Closing<br><br>All public rooms will remain open</p>
+</div></div>
