ta-testid="HomeIcon"><path d="M10 20v-6h4v6h5v-8h3L12 3 2 12h3v8z"></path></svg></div><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1oh5523">Rental Advertising</p></div><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-xyw44c">Advertise to top premium listing websites, using AI listing descriptions and a click of the button.</p></a><a target="_self" rel="" class="MuiBox-root mui-1rze8b3 LinkTo_link__fp_eP" href="/features/online-rent/"><div class="MuiStack-root mui-1ov46kg"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-640k4d"><svg width="0" height="0"><defs><linearGradient id="icon-gradient-payments" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#21BDE4"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#5EEDB4"></stop></linearGradient></defs></svg><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium mui-1unokdu" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="PaymentsIcon"><path d="M19 14V6c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2H3c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v8c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2m-9-1c-1.66 0-3-1.34-3-3s1.34-3 3-3 3 1.34 3 3-1.34 3-3 3m13-6v11c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4v-2h17V7z"></path></svg></div><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1oh5523">Online Rent Collection</p></div><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-xyw44c">$0 ACH fees. 100% of late fees go directly to you. Automated reminders and multiple payment options keep rent coming in on time.</p></a><a target="_self" rel="" class="MuiBox-root mui-1rze8b3 LinkTo_link__fp_eP" href="/features/repair-coordination/"><div class="MuiStack-root mui-1ov46kg"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-640k4d"><svg width="0" height="0"><defs><linearGradient id="icon-gradient-build" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#21BDE4"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#5EEDB4"></stop></linearGradient></defs></svg><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium mui-iweq6a" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="BuildIcon"><path d="m22.7 19-9.1-9.1c.9-2.3