-textSizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary MuiButton-root MuiButton-text MuiButton-textPrimary MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-textSizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary mui-zrttwm LinkTo_link__fp_eP" href="/agents/">See all agents<span class="MuiButton-icon MuiButton-endIcon MuiButton-iconSizeMedium mui-1n4a93h"><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium mui-vnjz4i" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="ArrowForwardIcon"><path d="m12 4-1.41 1.41L16.17 11H4v2h12.17l-5.58 5.59L12 20l8-8z"></path></svg></span></a></div></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-6mwctw"><div class="MuiStack-root mui-1svmaxw"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1namlgn">Local Agents For Your State</p><h2 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h2 mui-j8wu94">South Carolina-specific questions, answered.</h2><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-7ooe73">Common operator questions about running rentals on Hemlane. Each answer ties back to the state-specific workflow Hemlane runs.</p></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1qfu4w3"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1tboavl"><button class="MuiBox-root mui-crl738" type="button"><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1xec8af">Do I need a property management license to use Hemlane?</span><div class="MuiBox-root mui-hftidc"><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium mui-pjqlsr" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="ArrowBackIosNewIcon"><path d="M17.77 3.77 16 2 6 12l10 10 1.77-1.77L9.54 12z"></path></svg></div></button><div class="MuiBox-root mui-aq2z2w"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-yo6a33">You do not need a license to manage your own rental properties through Hemlane. If you manage rentals on behalf of others for compensation, your state may require a real estate broker’s license. Hemlane’s local agents are licensed professionals, so owners using the Agents service are always working with a licensed local expert.</p></div></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1tboavl"><button class="MuiBox-root mui-crl738" type="button"><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1xec8af">Does my state require a written lease agreement?</span><div class="MuiBox-root mui-hftidc"><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium mui-pjqlsr" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="ArrowBackIosNewIcon"><path d="M17.77 3.77 16 2 6 12l10 10 1.77-1.77L9.54 12z"></path></svg></div></button><div class="MuiBox-root mui-aq2z2w"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-yo6a33">Most states strongly recommend or require written lease agreements for all rental terms. Hemlane provides state-specific lease templates that include required disclosures and legally recognized terms which are ready to send with eSign in minutes.</p></div></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1tboavl"><button class="MuiBox-root mui-crl738" type="button"><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1xec8af">How does online rent collection work for landlords?</span><div class="MuiBox-root mui-hftidc"><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium mui-pjqlsr" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="ArrowBackIosNewIcon"><path d="M17.77 3.77 16 2 6 12l10 10 1.77-1.77L9.54 12z"></path></svg></div></button><div class="MuiBox-root mui-aq2z2w"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-yo6a33">Hemlane automates rent collection from end to end. Tenants pay online, and funds are deposited directly to the owner and not held in a third-party account. 100% of the rent goes directly to you. Automated reminders and late fee notices reduce manual follow-up so you get paid on time without chasing tenants.</p></div></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1tboavl"><button class="MuiBox-root mui-crl738" type="button"><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1xec8af">How do I handle late rent fees through Hemlane?</span><div class="MuiBox-root mui-hftidc"><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium mui-pjqlsr" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="ArrowBackIosNewIcon"><path d="M17.77 3.77 16 2 6 12l10 10 1.77-1.77L9.54 12z"></path></svg></div></button><div class="MuiBox-root mui-aq2z2w"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-yo6a33">Hemlane lets you configure automated late fees that align with your state’s legal limits. The platform sends automated reminders before rent is due and late notices after. Once the process is set-up, it runs without you having to make a single call.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-yc4vxv"><div class="MuiStack-root mui-1cdg1u5"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1sgnw3">Related Resources</p><h2 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h2 mui-cd3li9">South Carolina-specific landlord guides</h2><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1iepz3m">Deeper guides for specific South Carolina rental scenarios, written for landlords.</p></div><div class="MuiStack-root mui-1k9q6ep"><div class="MuiStack-root mui-10m7hmd"><a target="_self" rel="" class="MuiBox-root mui-1rze8b3 LinkTo_link__fp_eP" href="/resources/south-carolina-squatters-rights/"><div class="MuiStack-root mui-1ov46kg"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-640k4d"><svg width="0" height="0"><defs><linearGradient id="resource-icon-gradient-gavel" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#21BDE4"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#5EEDB4"></stop></linearGradient></defs></svg><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium mui-rj3ium" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="GavelIcon"><path d="m5.2494 8.0688 2.83-2.8269 14.1343 14.15-2.83 2.8269zm4.2363-4.2415 2.828-2.8289 5.6577 5.656-2.828 2.8289zM.9989 12.3147l2.8284-2.8285 5.6569 5.6569-2.8285 2.8284zM1 21h12v2H1z"></path></svg></div><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1oh5523">South Carolina Squa