endors to ensure prompt repairs, and we are on-call 24/7 for emergencies." tooltip-position="right"><span class="et-pb-icon tooltip"></span></span></span></li><li><span>Rent Collection <span tooltip="We manage all rent collections for your property. We have strict policies and standards in place to collect rent as effectively as possible." tooltip-position="right"><span class="et-pb-icon tooltip"></span></span></span></li><li><span>Eviction Process Handling <span tooltip="We handle the eviction process in the unlikely event that a tenant needs to be removed from the property. " tooltip-position="right"><span class="et-pb-icon tooltip"></span></span></span></li><li><span>Move-in / Out Inspections <span tooltip="Move in and Move out inspections. Detailed inspections with photos to show condition of property inside and out. " tooltip-position="right"><span class="et-pb-icon tooltip"></span></span></span></li><li><span>Property Accounting and Reporting <span tooltip="We have both a licensed CPA and inhouse accounting team to oversee all accounting and reporting functions. Data is shared with you 24/7 through our management software Buildium -- one of the leading, comprehensive, integrated accounting,  maintenance, and advertising program available to the industry. " tooltip-position="right"><span class="et-pb-icon tooltip"></span></span></span></li><li><span>24/7 Access to Property Financials <span tooltip="We simply your life by connecting you to our Owner Portal which you can access 24/7. This allows you to view anything associated with your property to include owner statements, financials, and reports. " tooltip-position="right"><span class="et-pb-icon tooltip"></span></span></span></li><li><span>Owner and Tenant Portals <span tooltip="We give you real-time access to your properties via your Buildium Owner Portal. Prospective residents can apply online, existing residents pay their rent online with a click of a button, and owner proceeds sent via ACH transfer. Much faster and safer than sending checks by mail!" tooltip-position="right"><span class="et-pb-icon tooltip"></span></span></span></li><li><span>Tenant Maintenance System <span tooltip="From a mobile device, Owners and tenants can conveniently place maintenance requests, schedule appointments, and communicate with us, making life simple for all." tooltip-position="right"><span class="et-pb-icon tooltip"></span></span></span></li><li><span>Leasing Guarantee <span tooltip="If a tenant we place into your rental property leaves within the first 9 months, we will not charge you a Leasing Commission to find a replacement tenant. (excluding moves for military orders or owner approved releases)" tooltip-position="right"><span class="et-pb-icon tooltip"></span></span></span></li><li><span>Pet Guarantee <span tooltip="While we are managing the property, we cover up to $2,000 in damage above the Security Deposit to your property that is caused by a pet we approved for your rental." tooltip-position="right"><span class="et-pb-icon tooltip"></span></span></span></li><li><span>Maintenance Guarantee <span tooltip="Maintenance service performed by our in-house maintenance company is guaranteed for workmanship for 1 year. (does not cover cost associated with defective materials)" tooltip-position="right"><span class="et-pb-icon tooltip"></span></span></span></li><li><span>Satisfaction Guarantee <span tooltip="If you are not satisfied with our services, and we can’t make it right, you can cancel our management agreement without penalty." tooltip-position="right"><span class="et-pb-icon tooltip"></span></span></span></li><li><span>Property Evaluations <span tooltip="Detailed, quarterly, on-sight evaluations of your property to review and report on property condition." tooltip-position="right"><span class="et-pb-icon tooltip"></span></span></span></li><li><span>Tenant Damage Guarantee <span tooltip="While we are managing the property, if a tenant we placed causes damage to your