+“As a local real estate attorney, I not only work with J&P for my own rental, but wholeheartedly refer my clients to them without reservation. Responsive, professional, experienced & handle issues with impeccable integrity.”
+Jennifer M
+“I cannot say enough about this management company! First and foremost they are the most friendly and professional people I have ever worked with. Making a payment or maintenance request is super easy and a response Is always given in a timely manner. Even through the pandemic J&P unlimited has went above and beyond my expectations. This is a management company I plan to use as long as I am renting!”
