hich at 10 median-rent Myrtle Beach-area units is about a tenth of the percentage-fee cost."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What does the 8-12% fee actually pay for?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Rent collection, tenant communication, bookkeeping and statements, maintenance coordination, and the physical work: showings, inspections, being on call. The office tasks are now automated well by software; the physical tasks are the part you genuinely cannot automate, and many owners handle them directly or pay per task rather than a monthly percentage."}}]}</script>
