+<div class="col-12 col-sm-6 col-md-6 flex justify-center flex-col items-center">
+<p><span class="font-semibold">Commission&nbsp;</span></p>
+<p>Seaside Vacations has always maintained highly competitive commission rates.
+Our goal is to keep our rates low so that our owners have more income to market their unit, make repairs or upgrades, or simply put in the bank! </p>
+</div>
+</div>
+<div class="row">
+<div class="col-12 col-sm-6 col-md-12">
+<p>Commissions vary from property to property. The rental manager will be happy to discuss these further. When owners refer guests to their properties, we lower the contracted commission rate for that reservation to 10%. Monthly rentals also receive a reduced commission rate.</p>
