+SECTION 40-57-70. Application and license fees; allocation of fees; annual report.
+(A) Fees relevant to the licensure and regulation of real estate brokers, associates, and property managers must be established in accordance with Section 40-1-50(D) and promulgated by regulation prior to implementation.
+(B) Application and license fees must be paid to the commission in advance and must accompany an examination application or a license application. An application fee is nonrefundable.
