+liability
+is limited
+—(A)
+In general.
+If
+paragraph (e)(4)(i)
+of this section applies for a
+taxable year
+to
+the
+taxpayer
+'s interest in an oil or gas well that would, but for
+the application
+of
+paragraph (e)(4)(i)
+of this section, by an
+interest
+in a
