+(C)
+Meaning of certain terms.
+For purposes of this paragraph (e)(4)(ii),
+the
+following
+terms
+shall have
+the
+meanings set forth below:
+(1)
+Allocable
+deductions
+.
+The
+deductions
+allocable to a
+taxable year
+are any
+deductions
+that arise in such
+year
+(within
+the
+meaning of
+§ 1.469-2T
+(d)(8)) and any
+deductions
+that are treated as
+deductions
+for such
+year
+under paragraph (f)(4) of this section.
+(2)
+Disqualified
+deductions
+.
+The
+taxpayer
+'s “disqualified
+deductions
+” from an
+oil
+or gas well for a
+taxable year
+are
+the
+taxpayer
+'s
+deductions
+—
+(i)
+That are attributable to such well and allocable to
+the
+taxable year
+; and
+(ii)
+With respect to which economic performance (within
+the
+meaning of section 461(h), without regard to section 461 (h)(3) or (i)(2)) occurs at a time during which
+the
+taxpayer
+'s only
+interest
+in
+the
+working
+interest
+is held through an
+entity
+that limits
+the
+taxpayer
+'s
+liability
+with respect to
+the
+drilling or operation of such well.
+(3)
+Net loss.
+The
+“net loss” of a
+taxpayer
+from an
+oil
+or gas well for a
+taxable year
+equals
+the
+amount
+by which
+the
+taxpayer
+'s
+deductions
+that are attributable to such
+oil
+or gas well and allocable to such
+year
