+	(D) All team advertising and marketing must contain the full name of the real estate brokerage firm and all team members must display and promote that they are directly connected to the brokerage firm under which the team works. In all team advertising and marketing, the team name may not be more than twice the size, prominence, or frequency of the full name of the brokerage firm.<br /><br />
+	(E) No team may imply that the team is a separate entity from the brokerage firm of its employment. Team names must end in &quot;[team name] team at [name of real estate brokerage firm]&quot;.<br /><br />
+	(F) The commission may promulgate regulations regarding the creation and operation of real estate teams, including requiring the registration of team names on a form prescribed by the commission.<br /><br />
